id: pm-jev-release-dependency-preparation
title: Prepare dependency-only daily releases with explicit release evidence
description: Daily Release run 43009061713 has no pending item after the latest tag. Investigate case-sensitive dependency fallback and preserve real dependency notes without empty releases.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
